  "texts": [
    {
      "text": "Bonjour, l'homme attend-il dans le hall de l'hôtel ?",
      "sha256": "8334d2074247416c9a14de89f30ab9507d0920cf8da5f223008ed861920fa132",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:11:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dans le hall, il voit l'affiche d'un film avec un héros célèbre.",
      "sha256": "903134d574d875c4da1dcd0ad2c39c8913d9fd36086264c7037dc663e817d1cd",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:11:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Il demande : « Qui a une voiture avec quatre roues en bon état ? »",
      "sha256": "ba30091664e5c8ead938b5d43966f301f654f1b7e08c2e1e84081ed0ec18b5ea",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:12:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[3].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "L'homme attend dans le hall.",
      "sha256": "ca4b1e884ca725e3113f11e2cd91b935b0d91c4192fa01dbdd90dc372c2bd497",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:11:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "L'hôtel ouvre à huit heures.",
      "sha256": "0c6755b2c1210589225406eb14951f70264117fc270a5775a7524210e407a346",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:11:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La roue du vélo est abîmée dans cette rue.",
      "sha256": "a9e0c04f3a04b715ee37c3c37dd0cefbb8ac201e9d3e11c025ecb9b883628752",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:12:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La roue du vélo est abîmée.",
      "sha256": "f58e84102724273a248e395a4e372f989fdb4389f728c22fad57151fda59e03a",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:12:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La vendeuse lui montre les haricots sur son étal.",
      "sha256": "69155444259025913468a1dd4f6393448a88c33da79870552b14c0356435dda9",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:11:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le héros est sur l'affiche.",
      "sha256": "27a6cd8542553d65d9fd70094435188597536925755051587c213578bac187c3",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:11:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Les haricots sont au marché.",
      "sha256": "34d68718343c53821d2b3ef270011013472bba05fa637621e7f70a86a7a73e29",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:11:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[10].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mais la roue du vélo est abîmée, alors tu appelles ton ami.",
      "sha256": "a02793c1ff2cfcddb3004f1324aa690d6b3288c6c36a8c896d8a3a8fc62de551",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:12:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Merci, je vais au marché chercher des haricots.",
      "sha256": "33b0678f0fd0c65bb66dcc196b2bfa5a4ee14139c46495049a527712942cbf9d",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:11:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Merci, tout est prêt pour partir.",
      "sha256": "6e9aea2b474f028eb9d79749f9ae0e4e03572bdc284185d48540c31f417a8275",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:12:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Puis il sort et demande où trouver des haricots pour le dîner.",
      "sha256": "e9cf621f716ae2e2ed95eb8455c585ccb09c93bb831c4973873b01f2e388bbae",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:11:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[3].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qui a quatre roues ?",
      "sha256": "95610d00a26c17c86ba8b5f846f0f702f036235ea92493d7f83f0a21d0d3657a",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:12:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tout est prêt pour partir.",
      "sha256": "808fb72a8965fb25f79f02e9416df44d2fb509be9487bf3a1bc0f626cc0ec8cf",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:12:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[10].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tu regardes la rue sur la carte avant de partir à vélo.",
      "sha256": "b14e53633ba0f8e56ee21c40a300d16baa3727b897cab4a340cfe5737553bafc",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:12:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[1].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tu vois la rue sur la carte ?",
      "sha256": "47a91fecbe6c93ae23ff66f0d834b31f62ffb411e81648730642bf3e4b8134db",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:12:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Une amie propose sa voiture et tout le monde peut partir.",
      "sha256": "5bbe193218813c6194e047a863f79a52bc61e2463ccc99760e2538b4a5005dd7",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:12:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
